{"w":2400,"h":3395,"lines":[{"h":0.013081395583944722,"t":"F","w":0.014403292338053389,"c":1,"x":0.080246913416021304,"y":0.2630813951222718},{"h":0.015685238742716101,"t":"Reading","x":0.83717154688793471,"y":0.064517912619849738,"c":1,"w":0.083042697906494101},{"w":0.77366256713867199,"y":0.1104240283706075,"h":0.017482948527880904,"t":"For years, repatriation efforts were carried out in small numbers, with the tortoises","c":1,"x":0.12757200850483011},{"y":0.12554101171977383,"t":"carried on the backs of men over weeks of long, treacherous hikes along narrow","x":0.12744935958598963,"w":0.75951075236002596,"h":0.021645284232599038,"c":1},{"t":"trails. But in November 2010, the environmentalist and Galápagos National Park","y":0.14534883739618643,"h":0.017489796111665123,"x":0.12757202948696297,"c":1,"w":0.75925923665364581},{"c":1,"t":"liaison officer Godfrey Merlin, a visiting private motor yacht captain and a helicopter","x":0.12757201477944705,"y":0.16424418590057022,"h":0.015988372380376759,"w":0.78806584676106772},{"h":0.01599008427632298,"y":0.18168433446878152,"c":1,"t":"pilot gathered around a table in a small café in Puerto Ayora on the island of Santa","x":0.12757200751758668,"w":0.77983540852864575},{"h":0.016195524146054185,"x":0.127572027735391,"y":0.19905771516326831,"c":1,"w":0.75925923665364581,"t":"Cruz to work out more ambitious reintroduction. The aim was to use a helicopter"},{"x":0.12540101685545588,"h":0.02153708319781944,"y":0.21403564109431894,"t":"to move 300 of the breeding centre's tortoises to various locations close to Sierra","c":1,"w":0.76566452026367182},{"y":0.23675079171132341,"w":0.069485257466634115,"h":0.015001563217109215,"t":"Negra.","x":0.12677157589170113,"c":1},{"h":0.016195524146054185,"c":1,"x":0.12757202513974372,"t":"This unprecedented effort was made possible by the owners of the 67-metre","w":0.72016459147135414,"y":0.26295641949719872},{"c":1,"x":0.12551439094936426,"y":0.28052325565468739,"t":"yacht White Cloud, who provided the Galapagos National Park with free use of","w":0.74691360473632817,"h":0.017474388486504955},{"h":0.017441860778592999,"t":"their helicopter and its experienced pilot, as well as the logistical support of the","w":0.74485595703124996,"y":0.29796511611897725,"c":1,"x":0.12551440823967727},{"t":"yacht, its captain and crew. Originally an air ambulance, the yacht's helicopter","x":0.12551440099370809,"y":0.31684334488743526,"w":0.7366255187988282,"h":0.016005492463128768,"c":1},{"w":0.73067021687825517,"h":0.019786335975458313,"y":0.33200897715280842,"x":0.12541879583513149,"c":1,"t":"has a rear double door and a large internal space that's well suited for cargo,"},{"x":0.12551439915147589,"t":"so a custom crate was designed to hold up to 33 tortoises with a total weight of","y":0.35174418589968748,"w":0.74897120157877606,"h":0.016041444524578563,"c":1},{"x":0.12551442474209484,"c":1,"w":0.77983535766601564,"y":0.36918604669851196,"t":"about 150 kilograms. This weight, together with that of the fuel, pilot and four crew,","h":0.017445284008839379},{"y":0.38808139520262253,"w":0.77366256713867188,"c":1,"x":0.12551439534568146,"h":0.01598837238037687,"t":"approached the helicopter's maximum payload, and there were times when it was"},{"c":1,"t":"clearly right on the edge of the helicopter's capabilities. During a period of three","w":0.75102879842122394,"x":0.12551440755893528,"h":0.017506915632771403,"y":0.40400471169487939},{"y":0.42285041234573084,"h":0.017667844522968212,"t":"days, a group of volunteers from the breeding centre worked around the clock to","x":0.12551441437024854,"w":0.75925923665364581,"c":1},{"c":1,"w":0.75720163981119781,"y":0.44040697713057075,"h":0.018956980800741041,"x":0.12551440644255393,"t":"prepare the young tortoises for transport. Meanwhile, park wardens, dropped off"},{"h":0.018895348053517669,"w":0.78395060221354163,"c":1,"t":"ahead of time in remote locations, cleared landing sites within the thick brush, cacti","x":0.12551441075022504,"y":0.4578488373649563},{"x":0.12529669585869435,"y":0.47637088645908543,"c":1,"h":0.016493445712068233,"w":0.15070870717366536,"t":"and lava rocks."},{"x":0.12551439909228274,"y":0.50436046495675446,"h":0.017441860778592999,"c":1,"w":0.74897120157877595,"t":"Upon their release, the juvenile tortoises quickly spread out over their ancestral"},{"t":"territory, investigating their new surroundings and feeding on the vegetation.","y":0.52179034158841253,"w":0.72222223917643236,"h":0.017453844611861058,"c":1,"x":0.12345678155189811},{"w":0.70576131184895829,"y":0.53916372227942566,"c":1,"x":0.12551440549709478,"t":"Eventually, one tiny tortoise came across a fully grown giant who had been","h":0.017667844522968212},{"t":"lumbering around the island for around a hundred years. The two stood side by","y":0.55649750667339004,"w":0.74910039265950512,"h":0.01911147154683368,"c":1,"x":0.12339907451283437},{"x":0.12551439251222282,"h":0.017469252798666735,"c":1,"t":"side, a powerful symbol of the regeneration of an ancient species.","w":0.62551442464192708,"y":0.57558139518898432},{"w":0.024691357612609877,"x":0.88888888899204899,"t":"61","y":0.93749999981703935,"h":0.013081395583944611,"c":1},{"c":1,"w":0.20850650787353514,"t":"leltsresources.org","h":0.0182130979845746,"x":0.39470117589381742,"y":0.96599008691701516}]}